		{
			dependencies: ["550D01E852BFE592"]
			description: [
				"The Tome of Alkahestry is a relic that is a gate to many riches. It was once banned and branded as an unholy relic that attracts greed and disaster. Nowadays, this is still a rare artifact for reliquerers. &cSebastian&r hasn't found one yet. Wait, that's not &chis&r name. What was it again? Does this tome cause memory issues?"
				""
				"The Tome is a vessel for transmutation, able to turn redstone into countless imaginable things. We can also harness its power to craft numerous staffs. "
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "7D281BDB1C2472F1"
