			description: [
				"What a cool name. That's what I think of it at least."
				""
				"&c\"That's just the name of the artifact.\"&r"
				""
				"Surely there's a deeper meaning? What are phoenixes anyways, haven't seen one of those around. Phoenix Down is created when pouring angelheart onto an angelic feather, yielding a more powerful, but less stackable way of cheating death."
