					}
					id: "reliquary:harvest_rod"
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 5.5d
			y: 10.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["471939DE22B5426B"]
			description: [
				"\"This looks like it could be used like in those firearms of the Judgement Pathway?\""
				""
				"&c\"Don't let its appearance fool you, this may look like a common pistol like yours, but this baby is actually a feat of magical engineering. Because of its components, it's able to accept an incredible variety of magically manufactured ammunitions without malfunctioning!\""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&c\"I've personally created magic bullets that seek enemies, concussive rounds that explode, ammo that delivers potion payloads, and many more! My go-to ranged option as a reliquer. It's joined me on many a monster hunt and I wouldn't be nearly as successful as I am on them without it!\"&r"
				""
				"\"Aren't you a reliquerer though, why a gun?\""
				""
				"&c\"Reliquer.\"&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&c\"...Why is it shaped like a gun? Well, unlike those stuffy wizards and sorcerers you see all over the place here, I can recognize an ergonomic design when I see one. I don't have to like the techies to understand when they've made a good design choice. Increases the modularity quite a bit too!\"&r"
				""
				"\"Do you think you could make it cast spells as well now?\""
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "4FB2DA70942ECABD"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "5DF2AFD74B5E9557"
					type: "xp_levels"
					xp_levels: 5
				}
				{
					count: 6
					id: "791C91D5259B91A0"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "reliquary:magazines/neutral_magazine"
						tag: {
							effects: [{
								duration: 200
								name: "minecraft:weakness"
								potency: 1
							}]
