		{
			dependencies: ["3220B67522BB5C0D"]
			description: [
				"I asked &cSantiago&r more about his so-called relics and the starting point of a reliquerer's craft. &c\"Well, if you're interested in fabricating relics of your own, then I'd say the very first thing you should get comfortable with crafting is the Void Tear. It isn't too difficult to scrounge up the materials, only really requiring a Ghast's tear, an Enderman's heart, a Slime's Pearl, and a bit of Lapis, but you should really stock up on the materials for it, since it's used as a base for many more complicated (and useful) relics.\"&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&c\"Not to say that it's completely worthless by itself, it can technically store infinite items! Only one item type at a time though. Regardless, this is absolutely the rookie reliquer's first steps.\"&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "081070F7CBF61207"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 3
