		}
		{
			dependencies: ["081070F7CBF61207"]
			description: ["&c\"The Infernal Tear is a sort-of-sidegrade sort-of-upgrade of the Void Tear. Instead of storing infinite of one item, the thing accepts all items, but get this! It converts anything placed inside into experience points. Definitely a nice pickup for getting rid of garbage that you pick up on your journeys, but it inherits the Void Tear's applicability in other relics' recipes. That's where I'd say its true value shines.\"&r"]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "550D01E852BFE592"
