					xp_levels: 1
				}
			]
			tasks: [{
				id: "60A3D710A6915E96"
				item: "reliquary:emperor_chalice"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 4.400000000000001d
			y: 11.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["081070F7CBF61207"]
			description: [
				"&c\"Oh, this meager thing? This was one of the first relics I had ever synthesized, experimenting with the properties of the Void Tear and first figuring out what was possible. It lobs harmful snowballs in the direction you point it, which isn't a terrible effect, but it's sort of outlived its usefulness in my arsenal. Still good against blazes, but not nearly as powerful as its 'older brother', so to speak.\""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&c\"Why do I still have it then? Well, call it a bit of sentimentality, hoarding, or whatever, but I've become attached to it. Also, you never know when some tricky beastie will just snatch whatever weapon you're using straight out of your hands. Never hurts to have a backup.\"&r"
				""
				"\"Isn't this just a handle for more powerful staffs though?\""
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "2D16C6149B35A925"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "445DFD06391020AC"
