		{
			dependencies: ["7EA2E0871C6D568C"]
			description: ["&6I've done it, this variant of the Witherless Rose blooms with bright colours, able to reverse effects of withering. I am getting closer to figuring out all-encompassing transmutation across all matter. I've used quite a lot of anti-withering elixir in my experiments, though. I don't think I'll be in need of those anymore."]
