		{
			dependencies: ["6FD39AE1113C3DC8"]
			description: ["Censer Golems can be found naturally generating in villages, alongside Iron Golems. Alternatively, you can create one yourself by using a Censer on a Carved Pumpkin, consuming both in the process. Censer Golems will follow other golems, villagers, players, and their pets around, applying blessing to them, or regeneration if they're in need of health. Censer Golems will also help out during raids, moving with increased urgency and providing an additional level of support. If they come across monsters or raiders, Censer Golems will waft clouds of negative potion effects at them. While most monsters aren't intelligent enough to recognize Censer Golems as potential nuisances, Raiders will target them if a Censer Golem applies a negative effect to them. Rarely, you might find a silver or rose-gold variant of the Censer Golem."]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
